- the used width is the widest line, not the box width
   - Expected: block.width_px equals `45)  # oracle: 45 — named expected value from the requirement`
- the used height is one line box per line
   - Expected: block.height_px equals `36)  # oracle: 36 — named expected value from the requirement`


